\r std:delete_pattern

\\ remove any redundant escape characters at the end of a line
o\(\)\@<!\%d27$
$v0"1y"_dd

@0
@1

\\ remove consecutive escape characters
o\(\)\@<!\%d27\zs\%d27\+
$v0"1y"_dd

@0
@1

\\ merge consecutive append chains like
\\ a..
\\ a..
\\ a..
\\ => a......
\\ first line can start with any insert mode motion like o, i, gi, etc.
\\ but all consecutive lines have to appends for the merge to be equivalent
\\ easier to achieve after segment module is implemented

\\ Remove redundant visual selections which don't perform any operation
\\ on their selected region. The cursor is still moved when selecting a region
\\ so the relevant section shouldn't be removed entirely--it should be replaced
\\ by the only the cursor motions performed in that region. This is assuming 'o'
\\ isn't used on the visual selection.
